###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Per-model energy-difference distributions (Fig. 5), position MAEs (Fig. 6) and optimisation-step counts (Fig. 4) are figure-only; the text states only ranges (e.g. most recent uMLIPs below 10 meV/atom on 3D; more than 75 % of eSEN energies within 10 meV/atom), not values per model and subset. Table II counts convergence failures, not errors.
# - MatterSim-v1-5m and M3GNet (MPF, 0.19M frames) are linked to the registry models MatterSim-v1 and M3GNet-MPF-2021.2.8; SevenNet-mf-ompa applies NequIP, following the registry convention for SevenNet.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
